\footery360\endnhere\pard\plain \qc \f1\cf1 {\b\fs48 Secure Authentication }
\par {\b\fs48 in an Insecure Environment}
\par 
\par J. G. Smith
\par 
\par \pard\plain \qj\li1440\ri1440 \f1\cf1 {\fs16 Secure authorization is increasingly important in today's Internet environment.  For small, well controlled environments, traditional authentication methods work well.  However, as systems become more 
decentralized and untrusted, secure authentication becomes more difficult.  Signed tickets in the form of cookies provide for an authentication mechanism comparable to existing methods in the level of security offered without compromising the integrity 
of the central authentication database.  In this paper, we present one such method being developed at Texas A&M University and a general methodology for evaluating authentication protocols.}
\par \pard\plain \qj\fi629 \f1\cf1 
